  "lines": [
    {
      "key": "trial_title",
      "when": {
        "n": "1"
      },
      "text": "The First Voice Returns"
    },
    {
      "key": "trial_title",
      "when": {
        "n": "2"
      },
      "text": "The Second Voice Returns"
    },
    {
      "key": "trial_followup",
      "when": {
        "n": "1"
      },
      "text": "'One voice back at the table,' he says. 'Bring me another.'"
    },
    {
      "key": "trial_followup",
      "when": {
        "n": "2"
      },
      "text": "'Two,' he says. 'Come and stand in the field with me. The earth wants a word, and so does the storm, and for once they want to talk about the same thing.'"
    },
    {
      "key": "shadow",
      "when": {
        "beat": "storm",
        "traitor": "joren"
      },
      "text": "The Register notes, without comment, that the last time this storm asked Joren Kall for something, he opened the wards."
    },
    {
      "key": "shadow",
      "when": {
        "beat": "ice",
        "traitor": "joren"
      },
      "text": "The Register notes that the ice was the only voice at his table that never asked him to open anything."
    },
    {
      "key": "shadow",
      "when": {
        "beat": "fire",
        "traitor": "joren"
      },
      "text": "The Register notes that the fire agreed with the man the storm was quoting, and walked out anyway. It does not say who else might have."
    },
    {
      "key": "shadow",
      "when": {},
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "remembrance",
      "when": {
        "beat": "ask",
        "remembered": "true"
      },
      "text": "'On file,' the Register murmurs. 'The same table. The fire walked out last time too, on the same night.'"
    },
    {
      "key": "remembrance",
      "when": {
        "beat": "told",
        "remembered": "true"
      },
      "text": "'On file,' the Register murmurs. 'The same field. The same condition. He has still told nobody else.'"
    },
    {
      "key": "remembrance",
      "when": {
        "beat": "inside",
        "remembered": "true"
      },
      "text": "'On file,' the Register murmurs. 'The same quiet. He shut his eyes for exactly as long.'"
    },
    {
      "key": "remembrance",
      "when": {
        "beat": "shadow_ask",
        "remembered": "true"
      },
      "text": "'On file,' the Register murmurs. 'The storm spoke first last time as well. He stopped it at the same word.'"
    },
    {
      "key": "remembrance",
      "when": {
        "beat": "shadow_told",
        "remembered": "true"
      },
      "text": "'On file,' the Register murmurs. 'He knew they were his words last time, too.'"
    },
    {
      "key": "remembrance",
      "when": {
        "beat": "shadow_end",
        "remembered": "true"
      },
      "text": "'On file,' the Register murmurs. 'The same hall. The same quiet, and what he heard in it.'"
    },
    {
      "key": "remembrance",
      "when": {},
      "text": ""
    }
  ]
}
